<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（二）培养原则</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>外部驱动力与内部驱动力相结合原则。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>教师专业发展需要内部驱动力与外部驱动力共同作用</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">,</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>形成合力。学校一方面着重利用各项行政管理手段从外部推动教师发展，通过政策导向牵引发展</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">,</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>培训研修提升发展</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">,</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>任务担子推动发展</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">,</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>教学竞赛促进发展</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">,</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>先进典型引领发展</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">,</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>学校环境激励发展。与此同时，激发教师个人成长内驱力，秉持对教师职业的敬畏，在目标的选择和榜样引领下，主动学习，积极进行课堂反思和教学研究，并在教育教学实践中提升自我。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>集中研修与分层培养相结合原则。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>依据教师专业发展的共性，开展集中研修。与此同此，遵循教师成长的规律，建立分层次的培养机制，明确目标、重点选拔、动态管理。学校将教师培养分成四个工程：职初教师启梦工程、骨干教师筑梦工程、名优教师追梦工程、卓越教师圆梦工程，分别制定培养方案。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（三）培养内容</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>建立集中研修与分层研修的教师培养体系</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>针对教师专业发展的共性问题，将以学校、学科组、备课组为单位开展的集中校本研修。每学期由教科室制定学期校本研修计划，定时间、定主题开展相关活动。集中研修主题包括但不限于师德师风专题、学科核心素养解读专题、生本课堂教学改革专题研修、特色课程建设与开发专题研修等等。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>针对不同层次教师发展的特殊问题，学校努力为教师实现发展目标创造条件，指导不同层次的培养教师制定好个人的发展规划，依据教师专业发展的不同层次，开展以下四个层次的专业研修。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>）职初教师依托《职初教师</FONT>“成长工作坊”实施方案》开展启梦工程</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>职初教师的培养采取工作坊的形式开展，开展研学、跟学、比学等多种形式的培训活动。实施基于规划的成长行动，从师德师风、班级管理</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">(</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>德育</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">)</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>和专业实践三方面开展研训活动。活动主要包括：学期初召开入职教师拜师及职初教师专题会议、教师教学实践专题培训、组织职初教师参加每年一次</FONT>“青年教师课堂教学比武”活动、期末教学材料检查等。通过开展观课、评课、议课、研课系列活动，提升其教学设计和教学实施能力等。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>）骨干教师依托《骨干教师</FONT>“提升计划”实施方案》开展筑梦工程</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>组织骨干教师参加学习培训、课堂研讨、品质课堂展示、主题报告等各项活动，给予更多学习、展示的机会，促进深入把握高中学科知识体系本质及思想方法，形成个人独特的教学风格。同时组织开展学科带头人等各项荣誉申报工作，促进骨干教师的高层次发展，建立区域学科教学教研中的学术影响力。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>）名优教师依托《名优教师</FONT>“攀登计划”实施方案》开展追梦工程</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>组织名优教师参加高层次培训，落实《名优教师攀登计划实施方案》。组织名优教师通过课堂研讨、品质课堂展示、主题报告等各项活动，形成个人独特的教学风格。同时组织开展学科带头人、绍兴名师、省市级各类课题申报等各项工作，促进名优教师的高层次发展，建立学科教学教研中的学术影响力和示范作用。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>）卓越教师依托《卓越教师</FONT>“领军计划”实施方案》开展圆梦工程</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>组织卓越教师开展名师工作室和更高端的学术培训活动，助推名师持续领航，推动其开展深层次学科研究，建立并扩大区域学科教学教研中的学术影响力。与此同时，利用卓越教师的示范辐射作用，引领优秀教师队伍建设发挥积极推动作用。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>搭建学习平台，促进教师提高政治思想水平和教育理论素养</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>定期向教师提供教育理论书籍和文章，组织撰写学习心得，举办教育智慧论坛、学习交流会、学习沙龙，组织外出参观、学习等。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">3. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>引导教师深入研究课堂教学，促进教师练就教学</FONT>“真功”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>规范各项教学常规，促进教师夯实教学功底。积极开展或组织教师参加各类公开课、示范课活动，通过开课促进教师研究课堂，提高教学能力。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">4. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>引导教师积极参加教科研，提高选修课的开设和开发能力</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
