<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 7.8pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd" align=center><FONT face=宋体><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 14.0000pt">   ——《名优教师“攀登计划“”实施方案》</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 等线; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 14.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>一、指导思想</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">    </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>通过培养，使名优教师培养对象在教育理念、教学理论、课堂教学能力、教育科研能力、教育教学业绩等方面达到更高层次的目标要求，成为能在教育教学实践中发挥示范作用的创新型教师，争取建成一支具有现代教育素养和创新精神，适应我校教育改革与发展的优秀创新团队。</FONT></SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>一、培养目标</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>根据学校教育教学发展要求，力争培养出：省级及以上优质课一等奖，省级及以上教坛新秀，省级及以上学科带头人等省级荣誉以上的教师。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">  </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>．具备较高的教育教学科研能力：获省级及以上课题立项或获奖。人均二篇论文（案例、教学设计等）核心刊物发表或获得省一等奖及以上，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>三、入选条件</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>热爱教育教学事业，为人师表，敬业爱岗，有对专业提升的强烈渴望与追求，具备良好的师德修养；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>遵守各项培训制度，有团队合作精神，能自觉、按时、高质完成各培训作业与任务；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>．学科专业知识扎实，教学业绩比较突出，教学满意度高，受到同行、学生及家长的好评，在校内有一定影响力和知名度；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>高级教师职初（优秀者可适当放宽）；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">5. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>至少还要具备下列条件之一：市级及以上名师培养对象；市级及以上学科带头人；市直及以上优质课一等奖；获得市级及以上学科专业荣誉；积极参加</FONT>“一师一优课”评比一等奖以上；在省级及以上刊物发表论文或案例</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>篇；指导学生获得省级及以上各类学科竞赛一等奖。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>四、选拔原则与程序</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>原则：以自愿为前提，坚持</FONT>“公开推荐、公平竞争、公正选拔”的原则，按照“个人申报、学科组推荐、学校审核”的方式，面向各学科招选符合条件的教师。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>程序：个人申报或学科组推荐、教科室审查、校党政联席会议讨论审核确定、党政办发文公布。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>五、培养方案</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>建立名师档案。认真完善学校名师档案库，及时掌握名师发展情况。档案包括：自学情况、业绩特长、专业成长、教学教研、学生管理、名师带徒情况等方面内容。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>创设平台。采取多种方式，积极为名师的成长创设相应的教学交流、研讨、展示的平台。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>）优先推荐。优先推荐参加省级及以上的各级各类教育教学先进评比。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
