<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>五、培养措施：继续扩大影响，校内外指导</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
