<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>）优先提供外出学习机会</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
